                {
                  "id": "h-professional-service",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Professional Semi Truck Brake Service Matters",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "professional-service"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-professional-service-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "While replacing some parts may seem straightforward, diagnosing an air brake system requires specialized knowledge and equipment.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-professional-service-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Every repair should include:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-professional-service-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Complete air system inspection"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Brake adjustment verification"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Leak testing"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Component inspection"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "DOT compliance checks"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-professional-service-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Professional semi truck brake service helps ensure every component is functioning properly before your truck returns to the road. At Sun State International, our technicians understand heavy-duty brake systems inside and out. Whether your truck needs routine maintenance or a complete brake repair, we'll identify the problem correctly the first time.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-choosing-quality-parts",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing Quality Commercial Truck Brake Parts",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "choosing-quality-parts"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-choosing-quality-parts-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not all replacement parts offer the same performance or longevity. Choosing quality commercial truck brake parts helps reduce repeat repairs, improve safety, and maximize uptime. Our parts specialists work with fleets and owner-operators every day to recommend components that meet manufacturer specifications and keep trucks operating reliably.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-choosing-quality-parts-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Combined with expert installation, quality parts help lower long-term maintenance costs while protecting one of your fleet's most important safety systems.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-keep-moving",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Keep Your Trucks Moving With Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "keep-moving"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-keep-moving-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "As a full-service commercial truck dealership, we know your goal is simple: keep your trucks on the road and your business moving forward. That commitment to customer success is at the core of everything we do. Whether you're looking for replacement air brake parts, preventative maintenance, or complete heavy-duty truck repair Florida businesses rely on, our team is ready to help. <a href=\"/service-appointment\">Schedule service with Sun State International today</a> and let our experienced technicians keep your air brake system performing at its best.",
